event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":137,"item_id":"rs_01735d5b69007772016ac94648c0448194908caa67a5bc287d","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing API validations**\n\nI need to set up a simple static browser app with API validation and test its built-in integration. It sounds like I have enough time for this and just need something basic. I’m thinking about securing the server content through textContent routes and ID strings while syncing with SQLite and managing directories using mkdir.\n\nI should handle generic malformed errors and ensure the front assets route, like /projects, works with numeric values. It’s important to make forms alert hidden for required fields and manage whitespace effectively. The scripts for client navigation should be straightforward to read and should match details fetched through JavaScript. The initial heading of Workboard will remain until I fetch and confirm details successfully."}

